
## Version 1.4.0

- Removed ConditionalConfigSync requirement
- Added serversync

## Version 1.3.0

- Migrated networking framework from legacy embedded libraries to an optimized **ConditionalConfigSync** implementation.
- Added a dedicated **"Lock Configuration"** master switch to protect multipliers from client-side overrides.
- Implemented a structural **"Mod Enabled"** fallback handler to clean up skill calculations when the customizer is deactivated.

## Fixed

- Replaced unstable runtime anonymous type objects within configuration definitions with explicit, strictly typed layouts to fix initialization crashes during boot sequences.
